上上题qSort()函数不支持排序规则函数，形如sorted()函数的key参数，为实现类似目标，横线处分别应填入代码是()。
```cpp
def qSort(lst, fx = None):
    if len(lst)<= 1：
        return lst
    else:
        Pivot = lst[0]
        if fx == None:
            Less = [x for x in lst[1:] if x <= Pivot]
            Greater = [x for x in lst[1:] if x > Pivot]
            return qSort(Less, fx) + [Pivot] + qSort(Greater,fx)
        else:
            Less = [x for x in lst[1:] if fx(x) <= fx(Pivot)]
            Greater = [x for x in lst[1:] if fx(x) > fx(Pivot)]
            return qSort(Less, fx) + [Pivot] + qSort(Greater,fx)

lstA=[1,2,11,12,21,21,2,3,41,4,3]
lstB = qSort(lstA, lambda x:x % 10)
print(lstA, lstB)
```

下面的Python代码中merge()函数的两个参数均为list类型，且是已按相同规则排序的数据。下面有关说法中，正确的是()。
```cpp
def merge(arr1, arr2):
    result = []
    while arr1 and arr2:
        if arr1[0] < arr2[0]:
            result.append(arr1.pop(0))
        else:
            result.append(arr2.pop(0))
    if arr1:
        result += arr1
    if arr2:
        result += arr2
    return result
```

