有关下面Python代码的说法，正确的是()。
```cpp
def bSearch(lst,val):
    def _bSearch(lst, Low, High, queryVal):
        if Low > High:
            return -1
        midIdx = (Low + High) // 2
        midVal = lst[midIdx]
        if queryVal == midVal:
            return midIdx
        elif queryVal < midVal:
            return _bSearch(lst, Low, midIdx - 1, queryVal)
        else:
            return _bSearch(lst, midIdx + 1, High, queryVal)
    return _bSearch(lst, 0, len(lst), val)

lst = list(range(10))
print(bSearch(lst,3))
```

